---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 글
description: 프로젝트를 진행하며 배운 것, 트러블슈팅, 가이드 모음.
---
{%- from "partials/macros.njk" import noteCard -%}
{%- set notes = collections.notesKo -%}
{%- set tags = notes | uniqueTags -%}
<div class="page-head">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <p class="page-head__label">things i learned</p>
    <h1 class="page-head__title">Notes</h1>
    <p class="page-head__intro">프로젝트를 진행하며 배운 것, 트러블슈팅, 가이드.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="container container--narrow">
  {%- if tags.length -%}
  <div class="note-filter" role="group" aria-label="태그 필터">
    <button data-tag="*" aria-pressed="true">전체</button>
    {%- for t in tags -%}<button data-tag="{{ t }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ t }}</button>{%- endfor -%}
  </div>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if notes.length -%}
  <div class="note-list">
    {%- for n in notes -%}{{ noteCard(n, "ko") }}{%- endfor -%}
  </div>
  {%- else -%}
  <p class="text-muted">아직 글이 없습니다. 곧 채워집니다.</p>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
